 "summary": "The new declarations (`linearMapAt_pullback`, `TensorProduct.inCoordinates_pullback`, the pullback and covering continuity lemmas, `bundleTensorEquivOfNeZero` and the `c\u2081` tensor lemmas) have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the closest analogues (`isoTensorUnitOfSectionNeZero` on smooth cores, the circle-specific `tensorLineEquiv`, the hom-bundle `inCoordinates_pullback_of_mem`) cannot replace them. The PR reuses `basisSingleton`, `continuous_bundleTensorMap`, `continuous_hom_bundle_iff`, `Continuous.tmul_section`, `bundleTensorCommHomeomorph` and the existing `firstChernClass_eq_*_of_fiberwise` lemmas, and generalises `lineCoord` in place instead of restating it.",
